N,G|               warnings. We catch glimpses as Blake and Schofield pass:             
N|               KEEP YOUR HEAD DOWN IN DAYLIGHT! ENEMY SNIPERS AT PLAY!              
O|
N|               They walk single file down the Front Line.                           
O|
