N|               knees.                                                               
O|
N|               He cries.                                                            
O|
N|               Big racking sobs - for the river, for life, for Blake, for           
N|               the baby.                                                            
N|               The morning is forming.                                              
O|
N|               Far off in the distance, something foreign, or long                  
N|               forgotten.                                                           
O|
N|               Music. Singing.                                                      
