N|               outside the door. He grabs Schofield’s arm as he passes.             
N|               Schofield turns.                                                     
O|
C|                                   MAJOR HEPBURN                                    
P|                             (heartfelt)                                            
U|                         Well done, lad.                                            
O|
C|                                   SCHOFIELD                                        
U|                         Thank you, Sir.                                            
O|
N|               Beat.                                                                
C,E|                                   SCHOFIELD (CONT'D)                               
U|                         Do you know where Lieutenant Blake                         
U|                         is, Sir?                                                   
O|
C|                                   MAJOR HEPBURN                                    
U|                         Blake?                                                     
O|
C|                                   SCHOFIELD                                        
U|                         There were two of us. I was sent                           
U|                         here with his brother.                                     
O|
N|               He looks at him. The Major understands.                              
C|                                   MAJOR HEPBURN                                    
U|                         Ah.                                                        
O|
N|               Beat.                                                                
O|
